# Modular monolith

Logical modules: Identity, Authorization, Policies, Approvals, Evidence, Audit, Notifications.

- Application handlers talk across modules only through ports in `Deleguard.Application.Abstractions`.
- Do not query another module's tables from a handler. Add a port and an infrastructure adapter.
- One deployable API plus one worker. Do not split microservices without an operational reason.
- Keep the product policy YAML independent of any engine (no raw Rego/Cedar as the customer contract).
